WEBVTT

00:00.870 --> 00:03.220
Great products start with listening.

00:04.160 --> 00:05.160
Connect GitHub,

00:05.370 --> 00:07.650
and choose the repositories for this workspace.

00:10.100 --> 00:12.200
Then connect your trusted sources:

00:12.450 --> 00:15.250
Zendesk, Slack, and Retell AI.

00:15.700 --> 00:18.650
Bring customer feedback together
in one workspace.

00:19.520 --> 00:22.950
But feedback comes in different words,
across different channels.

00:23.340 --> 00:27.250
CloseSpan connects the evidence
into clear product problems.

00:27.540 --> 00:31.260
Understand the customer impact,
and prioritize the right work.

00:31.640 --> 00:34.100
Give engineering a head start,
with a reviewable prompt

00:34.100 --> 00:36.760
and testable acceptance criteria.

00:37.150 --> 00:38.650
Your agent investigates.

00:38.650 --> 00:41.790
Your team tests and approves
the actions that matter.

00:42.190 --> 00:46.260
Track release evidence, and follow up
with the customers who raised the issue.

00:46.660 --> 00:49.200
From the first report to the final follow-up.

00:49.530 --> 00:50.220
CloseSpan.

00:50.540 --> 00:52.650
Make every piece of feedback count.
